Subject: [PATCH] Expose Cinematic mode for dada

The stock APK has no capability class keyed by the dada codename, so its
fallback capability reports Cinematic mode as unsupported even though the
module and recorder are included.  Make the capability gate reflect the
available dada camera implementation.
